   "filePath": "src/main/java/exchangeserver/core/ExchangeException.java",
   "summary": "Defines the runtime exception callers receive when a request gets no business result, with a Reason enum (BUSY, STOPPED, HALTED, INTERNAL_ERROR) that tells them whether to retry, resend, or give up.",
